    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7281" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-πομπή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπέμπω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sending up,</i> e.g. to the metropolis, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				30.9.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. θησαυρῶν</span>
			<i>digging up</i> of treasures, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>restoration,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τοὺς πεπρακότας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.290
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>reference, reduction,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ γένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					10.274
				</span></i>
			; <i>reference</i> to a book, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.Laod.
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(4).246
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>delegation</i> of jurisdiction, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				489
			</span></i><span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				19i1
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>.</div>
